      "content": "idk i'm kinda scared to drive to a doctor right now lol. the tightness is still there but it's not like i can't breathe or anything. it just feels weird. u think if i just take two of my loratadine instead of one it'll clear up the hives faster? i dont wanna wait days for an appointment if its just pollen.",
